      <div type="layout" source="#source-88726-88858" style="padding-inline-start: 3em">
        <p><seg n="1" type="heading" rend="dogyo" source="#source-88747-88807"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-88747-88765"><rb>栗鼠</rb><rt>りす</rt></ruby></seg><seg type="layout" source="#source-88807-88858" rend="chitsuki align(right) offset-from-end(2)" snh:layout-kind="chitsuki" snh:layout-params="align=right;offset-from-end=2"><seg source="#source-88840-88858">L'Écureuil</seg></seg></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-88858-89016">羽飾りだ！　羽飾りだ！　さよう、それに違いない。だがね、君、そいつはそんなとこへ着けるもんじゃないよ。</seg></p>
        <p><figure source="#source-89016-89084"><graphic url="fig43603_48.png" width="549px" height="532px"/><figDesc>栗鼠の挿絵</figDesc></figure></p>
